24 0 obj
<< /A 70 0 R /Alt (Diagram illustrating the interactions between the gut microbiome, tryptophan-kynurenine metabolic pathway, and mitochondrial stress as regulators of the central NF-kB-mediated immune signaling. Key cell types, signaling molecules, metabolic interactions, and miRNA target networks are depicted, highlighting pathways influencing inflammation and cellular responses.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 49 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
